OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain         
OL,6,Fcarrying on into the evening and       
OL,7,Fovernight, turning lighter further     
OL,8,Fwest and becoming drier for the Argyll 
OL,9,Fcoast and islands by morning, lighter  
OL,10,Fwinds too.                             
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with further lighter 
OL,13,Frain on Wednesday morning, becoming    
OL,14,Fdrier through the afternoon for most   
OL,15,Fareas apart from Argyll where patchy   
OL,16,Frain may linger.                       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
