OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry  
OL,6,Fwith bright spells on Thursday but     
OL,7,Fwinds strengthening and rain spreading 
OL,8,Fin later. Wet on Friday, wintry again  
OL,9,Fover hills. Turning brighter but cold  
OL,10,Fagain Friday and Saturday.             
